r"""apply_records_checks_v31.py -- after G4 v3m: records of the deep check, the gate's
provenance guard, per-behaviour accuracy, and controls for every audit / G3.5 check.

    python apply_records_checks_v31.py --root . --dry-run
    python apply_records_checks_v31.py --root .
    python verify_records_checks_v31.py --root .

Nothing here touches a code-signature module (generate_dataset_v3.SIGNATURE_MODULES):
data\v3m, data\phaseB_v3m and results\g4_v3m stay valid.

CODE
  src/rollout_gate_v3.py         gate.json records its provenance (export manifest hash and
                                 code signature, tuned config, mask, early-stopping metric,
                                 smoke); a resume with anything else is refused; a pre-v31
                                 gate.json is analysed as it is and resumed only with
                                 --adopt_legacy_results (recorded); --out is required (the old
                                 default held pre-v28 results); a cell missing any seed is
                                 INCOMPLETE; --es_metric (default unchanged); a clear message
                                 when the export is missing.
  src/train_supervised_v2.py     train_one(es_metric=...) -- default unchanged;
                                 evaluate(breakdown=True) adds contested accuracy per behaviour
                                 policy and per scenario, unweighted and weighted (off by
                                 default: training is unchanged).
  src/eval_students_v3.py (new)  the G4 students' imitation accuracy per behaviour policy,
                                 scenario and load bucket (DATASET_V3_SPEC §6) on a split of
                                 their export, or of a test-split export of the same dataset
                                 (--eval_data) -> <gate>/student_eval_<split>.json.
  src/preflight_dataset_v3_check.py  a real duplicate-key control for check 9; the report keeps
                                 the negative controls, per-cell diagnostics and saturation.
  src/audit_dataset_v3.py        controls for A, D (dijkstra, spbp), E and F; E/F as functions;
                                 F requires equality with the hash rule; docstring corrected;
                                 AUDIT_VERSION v31.
  verify_audit_exact_v30.py      accepts AUDIT_VERSION v31.
DOCS
  docs/DATASET_V3_SPEC.md        status (G4 PASS, milestone closed); §0 #16 corrected with the
                                 v3m offenders; §0 #17 SP-BP tie order; #18 held-out seed
                                 coupling; #19 anchors; V3-5 / V3-10 / V3-12; §7 v31; §9 actual
                                 run and the corrected export rule; §10 steps 5-8; §11 rows;
                                 §12 items 1, 2, 4, 5, 7 updated and 9-14 added.
  docs/CLAUDE.md                 status; FILE1/FILE2 are history; never edit a signature module
                                 without regenerating.
  docs/FANET_Full_Project_Report.md  a dated-record banner; defect ledger entries 49-54.
  results/README.md              v31 note; g4_v3m and v29 smoke rows; the 1000 s oracle panels
                                 marked pre-v28; the teacher decision recorded.

Assertion-guarded str.replace, as docs/CLAUDE.md requires: every anchor must match exactly once, all
edits are staged in memory, nothing is written unless every anchor in every file matches.
A file whose guard string is present is skipped (idempotent). Reads with universal
newlines, writes LF.
"""
